'''Class Rep Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Heartbeat Catcademy (Event Gacha)|Heartbeat Catcademy]] [[Cat Capsule#Collaboration Event Capsule|Event Cat Capsule]]. It was added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 696
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Class Rep Cat
|name2 = Stealth Class Rep Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Stealth Class Rep Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
While he may seem like a decent crowd controller at first glance, there are usually better options against his target traits. [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] absolutely knocks him out of the park against Dark enemies, and [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] can do the same against Red enemies, not to mention [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], who can also Slow Red enemies, but has much superior stats.

That being said, however, he does have a niche in very specific stages, such as [[Red Rectangle (Cats of the Cosmos)|Red Rectangle]] in Chapter 3, and [[Restriction Stage]]s that only allow Heartbeat Catcademy units.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

